<title>LATVIA: LATVIA-UNIBANKA AUCTION RESULTS DUE AFTER 1400.</title>
<headline>LATVIA-UNIBANKA AUCTION RESULTS DUE AFTER 1400.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The results of an auction of one million state shares in leading bank Unibanka are due at around 1400 (1100 GMT), the Riga bourse said.</p>
<p>The price under which offers can be entered is 3.05 lats.</p>
<p>Unibanka, an official list stock, dominated last week's bourse trade and it rose two santimes to 3.21 lats at the morning price fix today.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsrokm, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
